<div class="relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden bg-[#020611] text-neutral-100">
  <div
    id="network-pulse-canvas"
    phx-hook="NetworkPulse"
    phx-update="ignore"
    class="absolute inset-0"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 flex min-h-screen flex-col">
    <header class="flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 sm:px-8">
      <div>
        <a
          href="/"
          class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-cyan-200/70 transition hover:text-cyan-100"
        >
          Bitblocks Experimental
        </a>
        <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[0.08em] text-white sm:text-5xl">
          Network Pulse
        </h1>
      </div>

      <div class="text-right text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-100/70">
        <div>Compression</div>
        <div class="mt-2">Stamp</div>
        <div class="mt-2">Expansion</div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between px-6 pb-8 pt-2 sm:px-8">
      <section class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-cyan-50/78 sm:text-base">
          A rhythmic sketch of proof-of-work as a breathing system: mempool pressure draws
          inward, miners compress search into a block, and a stamped block expands through the
          network before the cycle begins again.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="pointer-events-none flex flex-1 items-center justify-center">
        <div class="max-w-xl text-center">
          <p class="text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.42em] text-cyan-100/55">
            Digital Metabolism
          </p>
          <p class="mt-5 text-2xl font-light leading-relaxed text-white/92 sm:text-4xl">
            Each block interval becomes a beat in the system’s metabolism.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr_1fr]">
        <article class="rounded-3xl border border-cyan-200/10 bg-white/5 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm">
          <p class="text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-cyan-100/55">
            Mempool Pressure
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-3xl text-cyan-50 sm:text-4xl">
            <%= format_count(@mempool_count) %>
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-cyan-50/65">
            Current transactions waiting to be stamped into a block.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-100/45">
            <%= format_bytes(@mempool_bytes) %> queued
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-3xl border border-orange-200/10 bg-white/5 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm">
          <p class="text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-orange-100/55">
            Last Stamp
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-3xl text-orange-50 sm:text-4xl">
            <%= format_count(@last_block_tx_count) %>
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-orange-50/65">
            Transactions visualized in the most recent block pulse.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-3xl border border-emerald-200/10 bg-white/5 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm">
          <p class="text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-emerald-100/55">
            Chain Beat
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-3xl text-emerald-50 sm:text-4xl">
            <%= if @block_height, do: format_count(@block_height), else: "Waiting" %>
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-emerald-50/65">
            <%= if @rpc_online, do: "Live RPC data is feeding the pulse.", else: "RPC offline. The pulse is idling on ambient motion." %>
          </p>
          <%= if @last_block_seen_at do %>
            <time
              datetime={@last_block_seen_at}
              class="mt-4 block text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-emerald-100/45"
            >
              Last block seen at <%= @last_block_seen_at %>
            </time>
          <% end %>
        </article>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
</div>
